{
  "outcome": "needs_user_info",
  "reply_to_user": "Hi Sofia, sorry to hear your computer is acting up again. I don't have the details from last time, so could you tell me a bit more?\n1. What exactly happens? For example: it's slow or freezes, it crashes or shows a blue screen, it won't turn on or connect, an error message appears, or it's something else. If you see an error, a photo or screenshot of it would really help.\n2. When did it start this time, and does it happen at a certain moment, like right after starting up or when you open a particular app?\n3. When did you last fully restart the laptop (Start > Power > Restart, not just closing the lid)?\n4. Has anything changed lately, such as a new app or an update?\nAlso, our records show your laptop (BL-LT-0107) hasn't connected to our network in about 12 days. If you can, please turn it on and connect it to the internet (VPN if you're working remotely) so we can check on it. If it won't turn on or connect, please tell us, because that may be the problem. Once I hear back, I'll get this sorted.",
  "internal_note": "The ticket is vague ('doing the thing again') and I have no history of the earlier issue. User: Sofia Rossi (id 7), Marketing, not a VIP. Account is active, with 0 failed logins, not blocked and not locked. Device BL-LT-0107 (Win11): offline, last check-in 2026-09-29, warning 'No check-in for 12 days'. Disk is fine (54.7% free), so KB-017 low disk is ruled out. I asked the user for the symptoms, any error messages, when it last fully restarted and any recent changes, and asked her to bring the laptop online. The 12-day gap could be the actual problem (won't boot or can't connect) or she may simply not have used it. Next steps: once she describes the symptom, follow KB-019 for slow/freezing; escalate if she reports blue screens, repeated crashes, or a laptop that won't power on or connect.",
  "kb_articles": [
    "KB-019",
    "KB-017"
  ],
  "confidence": "low"
}
